5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I don't like the smell in August! Can we see how other places do it?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,I agree. We should also check the block ledger to see what we've spent.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let's look at the complaint log. I want to know why people are actually upset.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I want to know the time commitment. Let's check the supervised mornings on the next lane.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need the measurements of the five frontages to ensure any new spot is actually fair.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, will that help us find a better spot? I want to visit the station block's bin house too!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@May, if we look at the ward subsidy, we can see if a shelter is affordable.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, that's a good idea. Let's also check the station block's meeting minutes for drama.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@Midori, costs are one thing, but who does the work? I'll check the filing requirements.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, the complaint log is essential. I'll also look into the truck arrival times.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
