35,2,1,talk,Rin,,The bin house at the station block smells worse in summer! And supervising takes almost an hour.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,"We spend thirty-four thousand yen a year already, and a new shelter would be very expensive.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,Most complaints come from the person whose gate it's at. The station block ended up fighting over repairs.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,Filing for a build takes four months and signatures. Supervising is about twenty mornings a year per house.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"Some frontages are too narrow, and the truck arrives so early that a tight window is impossible.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Midori, if it's expensive, maybe we just move it? But @Asuka says some spots are too small.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shunichi, if we build something, the cost might be too high for some of us to handle.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Asuka, if we just move it, we might just shift the anger to a different neighbor.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Rin, twenty mornings a year is a lot of work. I don't want a job as a bin guard.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@May, the filing for moving the site is also a hassle. Every change needs a new notice.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,I just want it to not smell and not be a fight!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,A permanent structure seems too costly and creates more arguments over maintenance.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Exactly. The station block's minutes prove that ""permanent"" just means ""permanent arguing.""","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,And the time spent supervising is a hidden cost. Who is going to actually do it?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"Moving it is logically fair, but the physical space and paperwork make it difficult.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
