60,3,1,talk,Rin,,"I hate the smell of the bin house, so no enclosure. Let's just move it!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Midori,,Moving it is the cheapest option. I can't support a big construction bill.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Rotating the location seems the most diplomatic. It shares the burden and the annoyance.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,May,,Rotating is better than supervising. I can't commit to those early morning shifts.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"Rotating is the only way to be truly equal, despite the narrowness of some frontages.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, is it okay if it's a bit narrow for a while?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shunichi, do you think the neighbors will actually agree to a rotation?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Midori, it's better than one person feeling targeted for years. It's the fairest path.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,May,,"@Rin, as long as I'm not standing there for an hour every week, I'm in.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, it's not ideal, but it's better than the current unfair distribution.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Rin,,I vote for rotating!,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Midori,,I agree. Rotating is the most budget-friendly.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I'll vote for rotating to keep the peace.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,May,,Rotating it is. No one gets stuck with the work forever.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I vote for rotating. It's the most logical distribution of the burden.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
